      ],
      "source": "https://southtownsanantonioneighborhood.org/southtown-san-antonio-a-living-tapestry-of-history-art-and-community/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the 1980s and 1990s, affordable studios and a bohemian vibe drew artists who transformed abandoned storefronts along South Alamo Street into galleries and studios.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
